        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We design our human capital management practices and policies to instill and reinforce our core values (Safety, Accountability, Integrity, Respect, and Stewardship) and organization competencies (Be Strategic, Continuously Improve, Deliver Results, Engage Respectfully, Foster Collaboration, and Think Customer).",
